<main id="main">
<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation-table.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-table-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation-table.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/free-claim-calculators/">Calculators</a></li><li aria-current="page">Appraisal Readiness Quiz</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">Free checklist</p><h1>Appraisal Readiness Quiz: Is Your Claim File Ready?</h1><p class="lede">Strong appraisals are built before they start, with a complete file. Answer twelve quick questions to see where yours stands and what to fix first.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap">
<div class="tool tool-wide" data-tool="ready">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>Appraisal readiness quiz</span><i>12 questions · about two minutes</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <ol class="quiz"><li data-w="3" data-fix="Get written confirmation that coverage is accepted. If the claim was denied, talk to a Washington attorney or the OIC before considering appraisal."><span>Has the insurer accepted coverage for at least part of the loss?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="3" data-fix="Ask for the full line-item estimate in writing, not just the summary page."><span>Do you have the insurer’s complete, itemized estimate?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="3" data-fix="Get an independent, line-item estimate. A lump-sum bid won’t hold up in front of a panel."><span>Do you have your own itemized estimate from a contractor or estimator?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Gather every photo and note when each was taken. Add new photos of current conditions."><span>Do you have dated photos of the damage taken soon after the loss?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Find the Appraisal paragraph in the policy conditions and note any deadlines."><span>Have you read your policy’s appraisal clause?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Find the Suit Against Us clause and calendar the date. Our timeline planner can help."><span>Do you know your policy’s suit-limitation date?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Make reasonable temporary repairs and keep every receipt."><span>Have temporary repairs been made and receipts saved?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="Download or request your current declarations page."><span>Do you have your current declarations page?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Make sure wet walls, attics, crawl spaces and roof decking have been inspected so the scope is complete."><span>Has hidden damage been opened up and documented?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="Collect emails, letters and claim notes in date order."><span>Is your correspondence with the insurer organized by date?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Run the numbers in our appraisal payoff calculator. A small gap may not justify appraisal costs."><span>Is the gap between estimates more than about 10% or $5,000?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="If a proof of loss was requested, send it on time."><span>Has a sworn proof of loss been sent if the insurer asked for one?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn ghost small" data-reset>Reset answers</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out tool-out-gauge" aria-live="polite">
      <div>
        <svg class="gauge" viewBox="0 0 200 110" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 100 A80 80 0 0 1 180 100" fill="none" stroke="#e3efe9" stroke-width="18"/><path data-o="arc" d="M20 100 A80 80 0 0 1 180 100" fill="none" stroke="#008457" stroke-width="18" stroke-dasharray="251.3" stroke-dashoffset="251.3" style="transition:stroke-dashoffset .5s,stroke .3s"/></svg>
        <div class="gauge-num"><span data-o="score">–</span></div>
        <p class="hint center">Answered <span data-o="count">0 / 12</span></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="out-msg" data-o="verdict"></p>
        <p class="todo-h">Your to-do list</p>
        <ul class="todo" data-o="todo"></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="hint">For planning only. Results depend on the figures you enter and your policy’s terms. They aren’t a quote, an appraisal or legal advice, and nothing you enter is stored.</p></div></section>
<div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose">
<h2>How the score is weighted</h2>
<p>Questions about coverage, estimates and evidence carry the most weight because they decide whether appraisal is the right tool and how well your number will hold up. Paperwork items matter too, but they’re easier to fix.</p>
<h2>What your result means</h2>
<ul><li><strong>75 and above:</strong> your file is in good shape. A professional review of the gap is the logical next step.</li>
<li><strong>45 to 74:</strong> close the open items first. Each one strengthens your position.</li>
<li><strong>Below 45:</strong> demanding appraisal now could lock in a low number. Build the file first.</li></ul>
<h2>Questions about this calculator</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Is my information saved or sent anywhere?<svg class="ico chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. The quiz runs entirely in your browser and nothing is stored.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can I share my result with an appraiser?<svg class="ico chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Take a screenshot or note your to-do list and bring it to your consultation.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free calculators</h2><div class="cards3 tight"><a class="pcard rv" href="/free-claim-calculators/wildfire-total-loss-coverage-check/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-hillside.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-hillside-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire-hillside.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Free calculator</span><h3 class="pcard-t">Wildfire Total-Loss Coverage Check</h3><span class="pcard-p">Compare the real cost to rebuild after a wildfire with your dwelling, code and contents limits.</span><span class="pcard-more">Open <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/free-claim-calculators/appraisal-payoff-calculator/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-paperwork.webp" srcse